# Myriad (CR 702.116a): Herald of the Host (4/4) attacks Bot2 in a three-player game. For Bot3, the other opponent, Bot1 may create a token copy
# tapped and attacking: it does, so Bot3 takes the copy's power as Bot2 takes the original's, and the token is exiled at end of
# combat. The card's other keywords (Flying; Vigilance) are on it. Black Lotus and the Moxen pay for it with exactly its cost.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Herald of the Host
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Bot3 Deck]
Island x20

